sweeps.coverageNote:
Six standard WebSearch queries were used and no WebFetch. They did not return a complete national list of institutions teaching 221/I1 Стоматологія. The EDEBO register, the MON licence register and the full education.ua and vstup.osvita.ua dentistry listings cannot be opened from this environment.

The one institution found that is not on the known list is the International Academy of Ecology and Medicine (МАЕМ). It is private, with a 'pvnz-' prefix in the MON file name. Its city, current licence and licensed volume are not confirmed in these results, and the MON documents found are dated 2013 to 2018 or are ambiguous.

education.ua has regional 'I1 Стоматологія' ranking pages for Kyiv, Kharkiv, Lviv, Rivne, Vinnytsia, Dnipro, Kropyvnytskyi and Odesa, but the snippets did not name the institutions or link the figures to them. The institutions behind the Kropyvnytskyi and Rivne pages (possibly relocated Donetsk National Medical University and Luhansk State Medical University) are therefore not identified here.

Other leads were left out because the results gave no dentistry-specific content:
- an nmuofficial.com page (Bogomolets);
- an MON licence PDF for Kyiv City Medical Professional College (fakhova peredvyshcha osvita, not shown to be 221);
- a vnmu.edu.ua PDF (Vinnytsia, about international organisations);
- a kmu.edu.ua discussion PDF;
- vstup.osvita.ua y2025/r27/1292/1479975 (institution not identified in the snippet);
- Wikipedia 'Poltava State Medical University' (second article, covered under Poltava).
A Moldovan result (Nicolae Testemitanu, usmf.md) was also left out.

Known institutions that never came up in these 6 searches, such as Bukovinian, Lviv National Medical, Dnipro, Ivano-Frankivsk, Odesa National Medical, Ternopil, Vinnytsia, Zaporizhzhia, Sumy, Black Sea, Cherkasy, Volyn, the Kharkiv private institutes, Odesa International Medical University, International European University, King Danylo, Odesa Mechnikov and others, are NOT shown here to lack dentistry. Their absence is a search-coverage limit only.

Fees, dates and application windows quoted come from third-party aggregators (vstup.osvita.ua, education.ua) for 2024 to 2026 and are unverified. Nothing here establishes programme accreditation outcomes, international accreditation or destination-country recognition. The NAQA annex for Lviv Medical University shows the programme was listed, not the decision.
